OL,3,GNEWSAFour people die in Bootle house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died and a fifth
OL,7,Fperson has been taken to hospital after
OL,8,Fa house fire on Merseyside.
OL,10,FSix fire engines were at the scene at
OL,11,Fthe height of the blaze at the
OL,12,Fsemi-detached property in Stone Square
OL,13,Fin Bootle, Sefton, at 03:45 BST.
OL,15,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,16,Feight firefighters entered the house,
OL,17,Fwhich was well alight when they
OL,18,Farrived, to search for people inside
OL,19,Ffollowing an "intense fire which spread
OL,20,Fvery rapidly".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
